\newlabel{fig:compose}{{3}{11}{Modularity. A whole-system check of $G_1;G_2$ explores the product of both protocols with the world and the budget and re-explores it when either changes. \textsc {TC-Seq} types $G_2$ only at the interface $G_1$ exposes; the interface form lets that interface be a declared invariant coarser than the concrete exit set}{figure.caption.14}{}}
\newlabel{fig:compose@cref}{{[figure][3][]3}{[1][11][]11}}
